---
/**
 * Not found. GitHub Pages serves this one file for every missing path, in every locale: the
 * HTML is English and a small inline script switches to German or Turkish before the first
 * paint when the path starts with /de/ or /tr/. The 404 burns like the intro name.
 */
import '../styles/global.css';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { getProfile } from '../lib/content';
import {
  DEFAULT_LOCALE,
  LOCALES,
  MESSAGES,
  localePath,
  type Locale,
  type Messages,
} from '../lib/i18n';

/** Copy the inline script swaps in, keyed by locale. */
interface LocaleCopy {
  title: string;
  body: string;
  home: string;
  href: string;
}

const t: Messages = MESSAGES[DEFAULT_LOCALE];
const name: string = (await getProfile()).data.name;
const copy: Record<string, LocaleCopy> = Object.fromEntries(
  LOCALES.filter((l: Locale): boolean => l !== DEFAULT_LOCALE).map(
    (l: Locale): [string, LocaleCopy] => [
      l,
      {
        title: MESSAGES[l].notFound.title,
        body: MESSAGES[l].notFound.body,
        home: MESSAGES[l].backHome,
        href: localePath(l),
      },
    ],
  ),
);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>{`${t.notFound.title} (404)`}</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link
      rel="preload"
      href="/fonts/instrument-serif/InstrumentSerif-Italic.woff2"
      as="font"
      type="font/woff2"
      crossorigin
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="error-mist" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <header class="error-header">
      <a class="error-brand" href="/" data-home>{name}</a>
    </header>

    <main class="error" id="main">
      <div class="error-code-box" data-burn>
        <div class="error-fire" data-name-fire aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="error-code" data-intro-name aria-hidden="true">404</p>
        <canvas class="error-embers" data-name-embers aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      </div>
      <h1 class="error-title" data-copy="title">{t.notFound.title}</h1>
      <p class="error-body" data-copy="body">{t.notFound.body}</p>
      <div class="error-actions">
        <a class="pill-button" href="/" data-home>
          <span data-copy="home">{t.backHome}</span>
          <Icon name="arrow-right" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script is:inline define:vars={{ copy }}>
      const locale = location.pathname.split('/')[1] ?? '';
      const text = copy[locale];
      if (text) {
        document.documentElement.lang = locale;
        document.title = `${text.title} (404)`;
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach((el) => {
          el.textContent = text[el.dataset.copy];
        });
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-home]').forEach((link) => {
          link.setAttribute('href', text.href);
        });
      }
    </script>
    <script>
      import '../scripts/error';
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body {
    min-height: 100svh;
  }

  /* The stage's mist, fixed behind everything. */
  .error-mist {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(60vmax 60vmax at 0% 90%, rgba(62, 6, 95, 0.85), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(50vmax 50vmax at 100% 0%, rgba(112, 11, 151, 0.4), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(40vmax 40vmax at 90% 100%, rgba(142, 5, 194, 0.25), transparent 70%);
  }

  .error-header {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: calc(var(--header-h) + env(safe-area-inset-top));
    padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) calc(var(--gutter) + env(safe-area-inset-right)) 0
      calc(var(--gutter) + env(safe-area-inset-left));
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .error-brand {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(19px, 1.55vw, 22px);
  }

  .error-brand:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .error {
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: grid;
    place-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    padding: calc(var(--header-h) + 24px) var(--gutter) 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ── The code: same rolling fire colours as the intro name ── */
  .error-code-box {
    position: relative;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .error-code {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 0 0.28em;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(140px, 30vw, 380px);
    line-height: 0.85;
    letter-spacing: -0.024em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background-image: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      #8e05c2 0%,
      #c77dff 20%,
      #ff8fc8 38%,
      #ffe3a3 50%,
      #ff8fc8 62%,
      #c77dff 80%,
      #8e05c2 100%
    );
    background-size: 100% 2em;
    background-repeat: repeat-y;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 26px rgba(142, 5, 194, 0.55));
    animation: error-roll 6s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes error-roll {
    to {
      background-position: 0 -2em;
    }
  }

  .error-fire {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -70% -8% -6% -8%;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .error-fire :global(canvas) {
    display: block;
  }

  .error-embers {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -45% -6% -5% -6%;
    width: 112%;
    height: 150%;
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ── Copy ── */
  .error-title {
    margin-top: clamp(20px, 3vw, 36px);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .error-body {
    max-width: 34ch;
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: var(--haze);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .error-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 40px);
  }

  /* ── Entrance: the code first, then the words rise in ── */
  .error-code-box,
  .error-title,
  .error-body,
  .error-actions {
    animation: error-rise 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
  }

  .error-title {
    animation-delay: 0.12s;
  }

  .error-body {
    animation-delay: 0.2s;
  }

  .error-actions {
    animation-delay: 0.28s;
  }

  @keyframes error-rise {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(28px);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .error-code,
    .error-code-box,
    .error-title,
    .error-body,
    .error-actions {
      animation: none;
    }

    .error-fire,
    .error-embers {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
